# Stop marks an unstarted service disabled before class main is started.
# Product actions can stop a vendor service; redefining it would cross the
# init Treble subcontext boundary and is rejected on the actual device.
on init
    stop cpboot-daemon

    # qtaguid filters rows by these real groups; readable alone is insufficient.
    # Keep its kernel UID restrictions enabled and restrict direct control writes.
    chown root net_bw_stats /proc/net/xt_qtaguid/stats
    chmod 0440 /proc/net/xt_qtaguid/stats
    chown root net_bw_acct /proc/net/xt_qtaguid/ctrl
    chmod 0660 /proc/net/xt_qtaguid/ctrl

# The Samsung SIGTERM handler joins its own thread. Init stop uses SIGKILL,
# closes the daemon's EFS descriptors before unmount, and leaves normal runtime
# behavior intact. This hook runs only after Android requests shutdown/reboot.
on shutdown
    stop mobicore
